  m_name: The Hungry Reef
  m_entryIndex: 321
  m_fullBodyIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7549cebe4c65e744db6ef43e31306bc5, type: 3}
  m_description: 'What appears to be a small island may actually be the body of the
    Hungry Reef. Stone, coral, sand, and shipwrecks conceal its enormous form, while
    a massive mouth lies beneath the surface.


    When awakened, the island itself
    attacks with coral tentacles, falling rocks, and hidden jaws.


    Fire destroys
    its coral armor, exposing its vulnerable interior. The creature also becomes
    slower when starved.'
